></svg><h5>Effortless Deployments</h5></div><p>Automatically deploy Functions when changes are pushed to your GitHub repository, or via your CI/CD pipeline.</p></div><div><div class="Features_featureTitle__oyjT_"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chart-line"><path d="M3 3v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h16"></path><path d="m19 9-5 5-4-4-3 3"></path></svg><h5>Auto-scaling by Default</h5></div><p>Functions scale automatically to thousands of requests per second without affecting throughput or latency.</p></div></div></div><div><div class="Features_divider__1WGjU"></div><div class="Features_features__aEjtw"><div><div class="Features_featureTitle__oyjT_"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-cloud-cog"><circle cx="12" cy="17" r="3"></circle><path d="M4.2 15.1A7 7 0 1 1 15.71 8h1.79a4.5 4.5 0 0 1 2.5 8.2"></path><path d="m15.7 18.4-.9-.3"></path><path d="m9.2 15.9-.9-.3"></path><path d="m10.6 20.7.3-.9"></path><path d="m13.1 14.2.3-.9"></path><path d="m13.6 20.7-.4-1"></path><path d="m10.8 14.3-.4-1"></path><path d="m8.3 18.6 1-.4"></path><path d="m14.7 15.8 1-.4"></path></svg><h5>Network Whitelists</h5></div><p>Limit which IPs can invoke your Functions, as well as the domains that Functions can make requests to.</p></div><div><div class="Features_featureTitle__oyjT_"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-shield-check"><path d="M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z"></path><path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4"></path></svg><h5>Fine-grain Access Control</h5></div><p>Use Data Policies to define rules that dictate how and when Functions can access encrypted data.</p></div><div><div class="Features_featureTitle__oyjT_"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-file-check"><path d="M15 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V7Z"></path><path d="M14 2v4a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h4"></path><path d="m9 15 2 2 4-4"></path></svg><h5>Fully Compliant</h5></div><p>Functions are fully compliant with standards like PCI DSS, HIPAA and GDPR.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="Container_container__0SGNv Workflows_container__2vkOi"><div class="Workflows_text__G98QP"><h2 class="styles_text__Fvsk7">Adapt Functions for any security workflow</h2><p class="styles_text__Fvsk7">You&#x27;re in control of how data gets processed in a Function. Use them to validate, fetch, transform or analyze encrypted data — without ever handling it in plaintext.</p><div class="Workflows_workflows__rEHhe"><button class="Workflows_workflow__dKOBu" data-active="false">Validate encrypted data</button><button class="Workflows_workflow__dKOBu" data-active="false">Fetch and transform encrypted data</button><button class="Workflows_workflow__dKOBu" data-active="false">Aggregate and analyze encrypted data</button></div></div><div class="Workflows_assets__6a0SU"><div class="Workflows_asset__CrxAl" style="opacity:0"><svg width="100%" height="100%" viewBox="0 0 709 643" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M195.485 333.859L114.184 380.854C108.294 384.258 104.667 390.544 104.667 397.347V490.675C104.667 497.439 108.253 503.695 114.089 507.114L195.39 554.735C201.337 558.218 208.701 558.218 214.647 554.735L295.948 507.114C301.784 503.695 305.37 497.439 305.37 490.675V397.347C305.37 390.544 301.743 384.258 295.854 380.